{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_022090","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加意为“富饶的海岸”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"真是哥伦布给它起的名字吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这个嘛。不过在大航海时代，哥伦布确实曾来到利蒙附近。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"他的航海日志里写着，当时从<R=原住民,indígena>那里收到了许多黄金工艺品。也许这就是名字的由来。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=原住民,indígena>","cn_utf8_bytes":134,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED;AUX_DIARY_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"真奇怪。哥斯达黎加明明也不是能产出那么多黄金的地方。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那些人本来就是为了寻找<R=黄金之国,Zipangu>才出海的。大概一见黄金就走不动道了吧。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=黄金之国,Zipangu>","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED;AUX_SECOND_CLAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"就算没有黄金，哥斯达黎加也是个富饶的国家。森林、动物，还有热爱和平的人们……我想保护这一切。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":"AUX_MAJOR_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"……嗯，是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANSION_IGNORED"}]}